From: oop23 <ilidans01yt@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 05:50:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Anime get AniList as a second data source

For japanese animation (TMDb animation genre, japanese origin) the show
is looked up on AniList and checked against its TMDb titles: AniList's
description replaces a TMDb plot that is not in the user's language,
its score fills a missing rating, and the show is credited to AniList
(logo and links on details) even outside an Anime folder.
---
